  "geometry_notes": [
   "36W-82W: one template read from each 'SECTION THRU GIRDER' view: 30 in bottom, 6 1/2 in web, 7 1/2 in bottom edge, 5 1/2 in taper rise to the web face, R=8 in tangent fillets at both web/flange junctions, 3/4 x 3/4 in soffit bevels, square top corners.",
   "Top flange: 36W/45W 34 in wide, 3 7/8 in edge + 1 5/8 in taper to the web face; 54W/72W/82W 48 in wide, 3 in edge + 2 1/2 in taper.",
   "Web height between the taper intersections = depth - 18 1/2 in (17 1/2, 26 1/2, 35 1/2, 53 1/2, 63 1/2 in printed). Printed fillet tangent offsets (4 5/8, 7 15/16, 7 1/16, 7 1/4, 10 13/16, 4 5/8 in) agree with the tangent construction to <=0.05 in; the construction is used.",
   "28 in girder (Std 19.01): 18 in top and bottom, 6 in web, stack 3/4/11/6/4 in, straight tapers (no fillets), 3/4 in soffit bevel shown, 'NO BEVEL ON TOP OF GIRDER'.",
   "Gross concrete only: no strands, reinforcement, deck, haunch or end blocks."
  ],
